":0},"rowSpan":1,"columnSpan":5},"tableCellStyle":{"backgroundColor":{"color":{"rgbColor":{"red":0.92156863,"green":0.9411765,"blue":0.96862745}}}},"fields":"backgroundColor"}},{"insertText":{"location":{"index":20465,"tabId":"t.0"},"text":"H1 and H2 were supported for all three encoders (Figure 3). RAID v8 had lower error than k-NN on all 30 tasks for every encoder (MAE −0.151, 95% CI [−0.169, −0.133]; DINOv2 −0.073 [−0.088, −0.059]; SigLIP −0.084 [−0.097, −0.072]), and even its worst task was better than k-NN (Figure 2a). It also had lower error than the REGENT-style blend on all 30 tasks for every encoder. Against RAID v7 it was better on 26, 30 and 29 of 30 tasks (MAE −0.047 [−0.062, −0.034]; DINOv2 −0.099 [−0.124, −0.075]; SigLIP −0.082 [−0.100, −0.064]); on the few tasks where v7 was better, the difference was at most 0.011 (Figure 2b).\n"}},{"updateTextStyle":{"range":{"startIndex":20465,"endIndex":21079,"tabId":"t.0"},"textStyle":{},"fields":"bold,italic,underline,link,weightedFontFamily,foregroundColor,baselineOffset"}},{"updateParagraphStyle":{"range":{"startIndex":20465,"endIndex":21079,"tabId":"t.0"},"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"},"fields":"namedStyleType"}},{"insertText":{"location":{"index":21079,"tabId":"t.0"},"text":"\n"}},{"updateParagraphStyle":{"range":{"startIndex":21079,"endIndex":21080,"tabId":"t.0"},"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","alignment":"CENTER"},"fields":"namedStyleType,alignment"}},{"insertInlineImage":{"location":{"index":21079,"tabId":"t.0"},"uri":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ConstantinVictorBeatErtel/RAID/84e380715ea4bbb698c07e7ada226ac0857a5a74/paper/figures/fig2_zero_per_task.png","objectSize":{"width":{"magnitude":468,"unit":"PT"},"height":{"magnitude":640,"unit":"PT"}}}},{"insertText":{"location":{"index":21081,"tabId":"t.0"},"text":"Figure 2. Final tasks, no target training: RAID v8 error for each task and encoder (mean of three seeds) against k-NN (a) and against RAID v7 (b). Points below the dashed line favour RAID v8.\n"}},{"updateTextStyle":{"range":{"startIndex":21081,"endIndex":21273,"tabId":"t.0"},"textStyle":{},"fields":"bold,italic,underline,link,weightedFontFamily,foregroundColor,baselineOffset"}},{"updateParagraphStyle":{"range":{"startIndex":21081,"endIndex":21273,"tabId":"t.0"},"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT"},"fields":"namedStyleType"}},{"insertText":{"location":{"index":21273,"tabId":"t.0"},"text":"\n"}},{"updateParagraphStyle":{"range":{"startIndex":21273,"endIndex":21274,"tabId":"t.0"},"paragraphStyle":{"namedStyleType":"NORMAL_TEXT","alignment":"CENTER"},"fields":"namedStyleType,alignment"}},{"insertInlineImage":{"location":{"index":21273,"tabId":"t.0"},"uri":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ConstantinVictorBeatErtel/RAID/84e380715ea4bbb698c07e7ada226ac0857a5a74/paper/figures/fig3_hypotheses.png","objectSize":{"width":{"magnitude":468,"unit":"PT"},"height":{"magnitude":640,"unit":"PT"}}}}]